  <jpcrp_cor:MajorComponentsOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesIncreasedOrDecreasedAsResultOfAcquisitionOrDisposalOfBusinessOrMergerEtcWherebyCashWasPaidOrReceivedAsConsiderationTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;※２  現金及び現金同等物を対価とする事業の譲受けに係る資産及び負債の主な内訳&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:9pt;"&gt;当連結会計年度(自　&lt;span&gt;2023年３月１日&lt;/span&gt;　至　&lt;span&gt;2024年２月29日&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;連結子会社の事業の譲受けに伴う資産及び負債の内訳並び事業の譲受価額と事業譲受による収支(純額)との関係&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;事業を譲受した会社&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;㈱メディカル一光&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:359.2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:6pt;font-size:6pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
